                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this game like a decade ago and suddenly remembered it existed so I played it for Halloween. Still love it. I got Viktor's route back then and I got his again haha, I guess it's my fate? I'll leave a more in-depth review once I finish the game, but for now I want to say the characters and story are very charming. I like Cara as an MC and the brothers bounce off each other so well, their bickering is so fun to watch. I love their bonds and how they care for each other as well. There are some typos, but considering it's a free VN, I highly recommend it regardless. It's a fun time and a great pick for Halloween. Thank you for creating it, devs! This is one of my fave otomes :D",
